  "description": "The 725 is LEADER's first fixed-gear bike, born in 1999. Its original wide geometry frame is characterized by high stability and a stylish silhouette. Designed to gracefully navigate traffic stress, it is meant to be ridden with elegance.\n\nThe 725TR was redesigned with geometry optimized for street use when track bikes first began to be used for city riding. It continues to feature the traditional pure track geometry, with a longer wheelbase than other models for enhanced stability. This design improves cruising stability, making it a comfortable and less tiring ride.\n\nThe frame’s joints are so beautifully welded they could be mistaken for monocoque construction. This is achieved through a special process called smooth welding, where the weld marks are hand-polished and filled, balancing lightness and high strength. LEADER’s dedication to making high-quality fixed-gear bikes is evident in the meticulous craftsmanship of the 735TR\n\nA common topic with fixed-gear bikes is the \"brake issue.\" All LEADER fixed-gear bikes come standard with brakes. The 725 features an internal brake cable routing system, allowing for the attachment of brakes without compromising the bike's beautiful design.\n\nAvailable in sizes XS to XL, the 725 can fit a wide range of riders, from women to larger men. If you are unsure about your size, please feel free to contact us.",
